              "short": "$x=-4$ or $x=7$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2-3x-28&=0\\\\(x+4)(x-7)&=0\\\\x+4&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x-7=0\\\\x&=-4\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=7\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 30
          },
          {
