              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2-x&=12\\\\x^2-x-12&=0\\\\(x+3)(x-4)&=0\\\\x+3&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x-4=0\\\\x&=-3\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=4\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 37
          },
          {
